=== width 24, Join, Drop, first line None
Constructs that change
with the parser

Reference links: full
the text
(https://example.com/reference),
collapsed r1
(https://example.com/reference),
shortcut r1
(https://example.com/reference)
and undefined
[text][nope].

Reference image: [image:
alt text]
(https://example.com/image.png)
and [image: img]
(https://example.com/image.png)
and undefined
![alt][nope].

A footnote reference[1]
and another[2],
referenced in reverse
order of the definitions
below[2][1].

Text between the
definitions.

┌───┬───┐
│ a │ b │
├───┼───┤
│ 1 │ 2 │
├───┼───┤
│ 4 │   │
└───┴───┘

☑ 
☐ 
☐ 
☑ with text

Autolink literals:
ftp://example.com/file,
[ https://example.com
after a bracket,
WWW.example.com,
[a]www.example.com,
https://example.com/a]
and www.example.com]
(http://www.example.com]).

[1] The first footnote,
    written first.

[2] The second footnote,
    with a link
    (https://example.com).
